### ④ 타이포그래피
- **폰트 페어링**:
  - 영문 헤드: Means Web, Georgia fallback
  - 영문 본문·제품 UI: Graphik Web, Helvetica Neue, Arial fallback
  - 한글: Pretendard (OFL) / Noto Sans KR
- **위계**:
  - Display: 72px / 400 / 0.96 / -0.03em (마케팅 hero)
  - H1: 48px / 400 / 1.05 / -0.02em
  - H2: 32px / 700 / 1.15 / 0
  - H3: 22px / 700 / 1.27 / 0
  - Body Large: 18px / 400 / 1.55 / 0
  - Body: 16px / 400 / 1.5 / 0
  - Body Small: 14px / 400 / 1.43 / 0
  - Caption: 12px / 600 / 1.33 / 0.04em (uppercase)

